Error: Jet.InvalidCommandInput: `--listen` only accepts `-` (standard input and output), not `127.0.0.1:9999`
 Why: Jet needs valid command input before it can run this command
 Fix: Write `--listen=-` to speak `jet.session.v1` on stdio, or use `jet dev --serve` / `jet self lsp --serve` for a workspace socket
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InvalidCommandInput
